# App directory

- `layout.tsx` — fonts (Inter, Plus Jakarta Sans), Material Symbols CDN, metadata
- `page.tsx` — composes sections; keep as assembly only
- `globals.css` — `@theme` design tokens; custom utilities and keyframes

## Rules

- Do not move section markup into `page.tsx` — use `components/`
- New global tokens go in `@theme` in `globals.css`, not scattered hex values
- Server components by default; sections that need motion/scroll stay in `components/` as client components
